<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling falls on dollar, gains on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling falls on dollar, gains on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling fell for a fourth consecutive day against the dollar on Thursday but gained on pound, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 596.9700 against the dollar, down from Wednesday's rate of 596.7720. On the pound, the shilling rose to 1,010.6732 compared to Wednesday's 1,011.9776.</p>
</text>
